313
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,720
You, just eat your chicken feet.

314
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,360
Delicious.

315
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,760
Try it.

316
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:00,920
I won't eat it.

317
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:05,160
It's really good.
